#: scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e786121a960d2a6069fd8aef0ad333d2141e3ef7c826778944b9214d3d19a174
#. default-sha256: 19333f0c1af5f763d899f14f36b1222d28191aed62a99cadcb9804932faa9969
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a lot of pressure being under that much suspicion, huh. ⟪k:3⟫My heart was "
"pounding the whole time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫É muita pressão ficar sob tanta suspeita, hein. ⟪k:3⟫Meu coração estava batendo "
"forte o tempo todo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60cea2deddb6ebdf03332bc55cbd3290a6e32d02e06c7095a05f5fe122004023
#. default-sha256: 6a3caa13860fab6540ea4a736484695f1c18b079d11fefa5cf7868394d9e32df
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why’d you tell him that, anyway?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Por que disse isso a ele, de qualquer maneira?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7450636ed4e4349644c463143ae6079934f0eedb662d0762adfc5e3c8036da96
#. default-sha256: 1a403cdebfbb4b3fd2b96058f34de3c7f250696a15852a0344f15c2a4485a9e4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know, I know!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Besides, you have every intention of keeping your "
"promise, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu sei, eu sei!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Além disso, você tem toda a intenção de cumprir sua "
"promessa, não é?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c15c0b7caaffc88ff0a29f4f9f44eb11274542006694560b387a114520239247
#. default-sha256: 55de2537c5e7f9c16b26aacf83d7feaf3ab88d69cf30fb0d33f62013486d7501
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe, oh, you. You say it’s all on him,⟪k:3⟫but deep down, you know you’re on "
"his side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe, ah, você. Você diz que é tudo com ele,⟪k:3⟫mas no fundo, você sabe que "
"está do lado dele."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4d51546a280df472f308d9e334e2069745d8b9e1b1a398548af806b4b7af649
#. default-sha256: 865d6d9f0261fb66d9302b407422ac22611af5d80d4be87d616960fd003add38
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re complete strangers to this Mell,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but I can’t bring myself to think "
"of him that way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Somos completos estranhos para este Mell,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫mas não consigo pensar nele "
"dessa maneira."

#: scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b723e98349af03265be11765a0d4bcfc43f03004944b6a4b160fa368a649d9f
#. default-sha256: c3ba82065670d68c4413e6143a3365e7c3a6c8e1b9022324ebe152ded70c97d9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And you were actually there—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a part of his life—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫which I "
"imagine makes the sentiment all the stronger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E você estava realmente lá—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫uma parte da vida dele—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫o que "
"eu imagino torna o sentimento ainda mais forte."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a457c90d60b05d887670efb724d1730cb794c8c3eb43443a28f03f9efb65a949
#. default-sha256: 10b29477d81582ecb39ce70d014e582d126d127152fe5f394014ad07e3985968
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫don’t think of him... ⟪k:3⟫as a total stranger, no.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫However..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫não penso nele... ⟪k:3⟫como um total estranho, não.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Porém..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50911fd4892713748448e26d8ef1081fcc4fc033f22d16b267f03f3a3825e846
