msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s hard to say... ⟪k:3⟫but even if he doesn’t,⟪k:4⟫we still have the other two "
"men to worry about."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫É difícil dizer... ⟪k:3⟫mas mesmo que ele não tenha,⟪k:4⟫ainda temos os outros "
"dois homens para nos preocupar."

