msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He bears a great deal of regret.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He yearns for someone to save him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ele carrega muito arrependimento.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ele anseia por alguém para salvá-lo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fcb16876ba8c06d8e8869d89aa4a8eee7f76f4f1e870d698e635b06986f9227
#. default-sha256: e99c07093770518c6e59d509375eb34efad0ba514017f0367c5dce95832ee0e2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard him muttering, “This isn’t what I wanted.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He doesn’t want to be "
"involved in this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu o ouvi murmurando, “Isso não é o que eu queria.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ele não quer estar "
"envolvido nisso."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1f9adbc6f19424d46edf1049adaf19b81425ca3086956f18c6327cf8671bf56
