msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But we have knowledge—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫quite a bit of it, in fact."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mas temos conhecimento—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫bastante, na verdade.."

#: scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1facdda43ac00ce48898c8a9c935a9d098f797a52284d8706a7a9e49b72bc985
#. default-sha256: ac7d69ecd6441ee622fa1dc825cc470c1f659da872ba7f69bea58f9bb7e63c07
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I agree! If his darling sister tells him to stop,⟪k:3⟫he won’t have any reason to "
"continue his involvement!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu concordo! Se sua irmã querida disser para ele parar,⟪k:3⟫ele não terá motivos "
"para continuar se envolvendo!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 145e15d910ebbf6fc0402ce81ec8ca4dc22ad518604baf3f1a43e4dcc7df2c85
#. default-sha256: de0f155f75f00db053b0d0d5dc9bb3983c819a2ab5ffe1418397084edbfc157b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫is that people tend to keep those they care most about close by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫é que as pessoas tendem a manter as pessoas com quem mais se importam por perto.  "

#: scenario8:scenario8_C2FB13F6_DBC2_4FEE_8C81_AC7E38251B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bae5022c9cf84d75bb25c3d028398c932c533e97cf99a752757a3faffec9769e
